end itself with its spiked rear.",[24]="It lives among the tall grass and in forests. It repels attacks by raising up the spikes on its rear.",[25]="Using the spikes on its rear end, Wurmple peels the bark off trees and feeds on the sap that oozes out. This Pokémon’s feet are tipped with suction pads that allow it to cling to glass without slipping.",[26]="Wurmple is targeted by Swellow as prey. This Pokémon will try to resist by pointing the spikes on its rear at the attacking predator. It will weaken the foe by leaking poison from the spikes.",[39]="Likes sap and is abundant in the wild. Why it evolves into various different forms is unknown. One cannot tell from a Wurmple's appearance which form it will take when it evolves."},es={[23]="Le encanta comer hojas. Si le ataca un Starly, se defenderá con sus púas.",[24]="Vive en bosques y zonas de hierba alta. Si le atacan, se defiende con las púas venenosas de su cola.",[25]="Wurmple usa las púas del lomo para raspar los troncos de los árboles, quitarles la corteza y beber la savia que emanan. Este Pokémon tiene unas ventosas rematándole los pies, con las que se adhiere al cristal sin resbalarse.",[26]="Wurmple es la presa preferida de Swellow. La forma que tiene de intentar defenderse es apuntar con las púas del lomo al amenazante enemigo y debilitarlo inyectándole veneno."},pt="Gosta de seiva e é abundante na natureza. Não se sabe por que evolui para formas diferentes. Não é possível saber pela aparência de um Wurmple qual forma ele terá quando evoluir."},evo={{s=265},{s=266,from=265,c={{t="level-up",lv=7}}},{s=267,from=266,c={{t="level-up",lv=10}}},{s=268,from=265,c={{t="level-up",lv=7}}},{s=269,from=268,c={{t="level-up",lv=10}}}},moves={[5]={1,33,1,81,5,40},[6]={1,33,1,81,5,40},[7]={1,33,1,81,5,40},[8]={1,33,1,81,5,40},[9]={1,33,1,81,5,40,15,450},[10]={1,33,1,81,5,40,15,450},[11]={1,33,1,81,5,40,15,450},[12]={1,33,1,81,5,40},[13]={1,33,1,81,5,40},[14]={1,33,1,81,5,40,15,450},[15]={1,33,1,81,5,40,15,450},[16]={1,3